{"4928600": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Black Lake", "steam_appid": 4928600, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928600/extras/2c2decf9d194c9c0db73b8fb44232256.poster.avif?t=1784710615\" width=1170 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928600/extras/2c2decf9d194c9c0db73b8fb44232256.webm?t=1784710615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928600/extras/2c2decf9d194c9c0db73b8fb44232256.mp4?t=1784710615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elena</strong> returns to the <strong>place where she grew</strong> up after receiving a message from her <strong>missing twin sister</strong>, <strong>Rita</strong>. The orphanage should have been empty. Instead, its halls are still warm, <strong>the bells</strong> are ringing again, and something has been moving through the walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Following Rita’s trail</strong>, Elena begins to uncover the <strong>remains of a forbidden ritual</strong> connected to the <strong>children who vanished years ago</strong>. Some of them may still be inside, though not in any form she remembers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Black Lake</strong> is a <strong>story-driven first-person cosmic horror</strong> game set inside a <strong>ruined orphanage stranded in an endless black ocean.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928600/extras/67fe17ce067dc752a37784f1dfcaa5b4.poster.avif?t=1784710615\" width=1170 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928600/extras/67fe17ce067dc752a37784f1dfcaa5b4.webm?t=1784710615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928600/extras/67fe17ce067dc752a37784f1dfcaa5b4.mp4?t=1784710615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A Character-Driven Horror Story</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built around a <strong>carefully written</strong>, character-driven story, <strong>Black Lake</strong> tells a <strong>carefully crafted story</strong> about grief, guilt, sacrifice, and the <strong>cost of pursuing answers</strong> that were meant to remain buried.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every room has a purpose. Every encounter has meaning. <strong>Through exploration</strong>, <strong>memorable characters</strong>, and <strong>narrative-driven puzzles</strong>, Elena will uncover a mystery shaped by the <strong>lives of those who once called the orphanage home.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928600/extras/585549479bc255ccef338900bc93b2db.poster.avif?t=1784710615\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928600/extras/585549479bc255ccef338900bc93b2db.webm?t=1784710615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928600/extras/585549479bc255ccef338900bc93b2db.mp4?t=1784710615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive Against the Unknown</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Every encounter</strong> demands a different approach. <strong>Track unseen horrors with your phone</strong>, <strong>evade danger</strong> through <strong>stealth</strong> and <strong>distraction</strong>, and use <strong>limited resources</strong> wisely. <strong>Your revolver won't kill</strong> what's hunting you, but it might give you one <strong>last chance to run</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928600/extras/0021c5d60a2de5ae5ba0dbd9e3bcc1bf.poster.avif?t=1784710615\" width=1170 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928600/extras/0021c5d60a2de5ae5ba0dbd9e3bcc1bf.webm?t=1784710615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928600/extras/0021c5d60a2de5ae5ba0dbd9e3bcc1bf.mp4?t=1784710615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Return to the Orphanage</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore abandoned <strong>classrooms</strong>, flooded halls, <strong>forgotten chapels</strong>, <strong>underground passages</strong>, and places that should not exist <strong>beneath the orphanage</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The <strong>environment</strong> is <strong>interconnected</strong> and <strong>rewards careful observation</strong>. <strong>Hidden routes</strong>, <strong>environmental details</strong>, and the remains of everyday life gradually reveal what happened to the children and why Rita came back.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928600/extras/1d165a7ccfd76f45dfe6b8ad2bf516bc.poster.avif?t=1784710615\" width=1170 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928600/extras/1d165a7ccfd76f45dfe6b8ad2bf516bc.webm?t=1784710615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928600/extras/1d165a7ccfd76f45dfe6b8ad2bf516bc.mp4?t=1784710615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Multiple Outcomes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your choices</strong>, the <strong>people you trust,</strong> <strong>the secrets you uncover</strong>, and the way you <strong>survive</strong> can lead the story toward <strong>different outcomes</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928600/extras/f8348eae55b14645bfd862d7d61ce973.poster.avif?t=1784710615\" width=1170 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928600/extras/f8348eae55b14645bfd862d7d61ce973.webm?t=1784710615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928600/extras/f8348eae55b14645bfd862d7d61ce973.mp4?t=1784710615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Keep the Candles Burning</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Use candles</strong> to create a <strong>temporary safehouse</strong> throughout the orphanage, giving Elena a moment to <strong>recover, manage her resources</strong>, and prepare for the darkness ahead.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But safety never lasts forever.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928600/extras/1f7117015b6efd4904c1fec4a25dc8e2.poster.avif?t=1784710615\" width=1170 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928600/extras/1f7117015b6efd4904c1fec4a25dc8e2.webm?t=1784710615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928600/extras/1f7117015b6efd4904c1fec4a25dc8e2.mp4?t=1784710615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>See What the Eye Cannot</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elena’s phone</strong> is more than a source of light. Through its screen, she can <strong>uncover hidden clues</strong>, <strong>communicate with those who remain</strong>, and see <strong>threats invisible to the naked eye.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Keep the battery alive</strong>. Sometimes the screen is the only warning you will receive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928600/extras/2c2decf9d194c9c0db73b8fb44232256.poster.avif?t=1784710615\" width=1170 height=416 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928600/extras/2c2decf9d194c9c0db73b8fb44232256.webm?t=1784710615\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4928600/extras/2c2decf9d194c9c0db73b8fb44232256.mp4?t=1784710615\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Elena</strong> returns to the <strong>place where she grew</strong> up after receiving a message from her <strong>missing twin sister</strong>, <strong>Rita</strong>. The orphanage should have been empty. Instead, its halls are still warm, <strong>the bells</strong> are ringing again, and something has been moving through the walls.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Following Rita’s trail</strong>, Elena begins to uncover the <strong>remains of a forbidden ritual</strong> connected to the <strong>children who vanished years ago</strong>. Some of them may still be inside, thoug